\section{2025年专转本英语阅读冲刺讲义}
\subsection{细节题解题技巧}

\questiontype{【题型特征】}
细节题是专转本英语阅读的高频题型，占比约30\%，核心考查学生定位原文关键信息、理解句意的能力。解题核心步骤：定位词查找→原文区间匹配→选项对比排除。

\questiontype{【2024年真题示例】}
\textbf{题干}：When the author says ``People tend to \keyword{overlook} the \keyword{hidden costs} of online shopping'', he means that \_\_\_\_.

\begin{enumerate}[label=\Alph*), leftmargin=2em]
  \item People usually ignore the indirect expenses of online shopping
  \item People often forget to check the total price of online purchases
  \item People rarely notice the delivery fees of online shopping
  \item People never care about the quality of online shopping goods
\end{enumerate}

\begin{analysis}
本题定位词为 \keyword{hidden costs}，对应原文第二段第二句 ``Many consumers fail to realize the extra charges beyond the marked price''，其中 ``hidden costs'' 与 ``extra charges beyond the marked price'' 为同义替换。

\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=2em]
  \item[\textbf{A}] \keyword{indirect expenses} 对应 ``hidden costs''，为正确答案；
  \item[\textbf{B}] ``total price'' 侧重总价，而非“隐藏成本”，属于概念偷换；
  \item[\textbf{C}] ``delivery fees'' 仅为隐藏成本的一种，以偏概全；
  \item[\textbf{D}] ``never care about'' 语气绝对，原文无对应表述。
\end{itemize}
\end{analysis}

\questiontype{【核心生词】}
\vocab{overlook}{v}{忽视；忽略}
\vocab{hidden}{adj}{隐藏的；隐秘的}
\vocab{expense}{n}{费用；开支}

